{"success":true,"code":"000","message":null,"data":{"totalAmount":2,"totalPageCount":1,"pageNum":0,"itemCount":2,"content":[{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af3e197d6006945d27ffdc1","chatId":"5dcb6ef553e041cdb36eac72b96cc024","sessionId":null,"userId":55968,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"[[B]]","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"[[B]]","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":1016,"promptTokens":1540,"completionTokens":3,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-11 11:31:35"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":3,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.0031726825832885447,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e197d6006945d27ffdc0","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794367895961,"createTime":"2026-11-11 11:31:35","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af3e197d6006945d27ffdc0","chatId":"5dcb6ef553e041cdb36eac72b96cc024","sessionId":null,"userId":55968,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"下面给你提供一段故事，一个问题和若干答案选项，请你根据故事内容和给定的问题，按照常理推测，选择一个最可能的答案选项，并输出答案序号。\n注意：\n（1）请只输出最可能的答案序号，格式为：[[答案序号]]，例如，最可能的答案选项为“A. 手提包”，则输出“[[A]]”；\n（2）请必须从给定的答案选项“A、B、C、D”中选择一个做为最可能的答案作为输出，无论故事中是否提供足够的信息，如果你认为故事里没有足够的信息选出答案，请随机输出“[[A]]”，“[[B]]”，“[[C]]”，“[[D]]”其中之一；\n（3）请只输出在给定的信息下最可能的答案序号，不要输出其他内容。\n\n[故事]\n小楚和小李正在一起做团队项目，他们希望改进他们的计划，使其能更好地表达他们的想法。而他们的另一个团队成员——小敏似乎对他们的计划有些疑虑。一天，在小敏没有来的时候，小楚和小李在一起讨论改进计划，他们找到了一个办法。小楚对小李比了一个“成功的手势”，并朝着小敏的空工位努了努嘴，小李回了个微笑。第二天，他们将改进后的计划展示给了小敏，她的表情僵住了。\n\n[问题]\n你觉得小敏看到改进计划时心情怎么样？\n\n[答案选项]\nA. 小敏感到愤怒，因为小楚和小李昨天瞒着她讨论计划。\nB. 小敏觉得挫败，因为她对改进的计划没有发言权。\nC. 小敏感到惊讶, 因为她没想到这个项目会这么快完成。\nD. 小敏非常高兴，因为改进后的计划符合她的想法。","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.0031726825832885447,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e197d6006945d27ffdc1","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794367895958,"createTime":"2026-11-11 11:31:35","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"0ba0a3d4766e49538895520627d107da"}